.IX Title "ICEWM-FOCUS_MODE 5"
.TH ICEWM-FOCUS_MODE 5 2026-08-06 "icewm\ 4.1.0" "Standards, Environments and Macros"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
